  "details": "There was a big update awhile ago that added the \"Calibrate\" button to the game for FBT users, and also fixed issues with viewballs not lining up correctly when sitting down (for example, when you sat down your viewball would be more near your neck/mouth than your eyes, and laying down even worse).\nNot sure what happened, but it seems those changes have been reversed with some kind of IK update, since it has gone right back to the way it used to be before where the viewball does not line up with your view anymore if you sit or lay down.",
